[Bb]Life that is [F]full, and sal[C]vation so [G]free...[G7]
[C]Saved by Your [Em]grace, and not [F]by what I [C]do;
Jesus, my [Dm]Lord, I [G]love[G7] [C]You![F][C][G][G7]

Verse 2
